        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q08-practice-01",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求满足递推关系 $x_n=3x_{n-1}-2x_{n-2}$，初值 $x_0=1,x_1=3$ 的通项公式 $x_n$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "线性递推方程",
        "特征方程"
      ],
      "question_type": "递推数列求通项",
      "method": [
        "特征方程法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求特征方程根",
        "写出通解并代入初值求系数"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_recurrence_characteristic",
        "template": "x_n=3x_{n-1}-2x_{n-2}, x_0=1,x_1=3",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "特征方程 $r^2-3r+2=0\\Rightarrow(r-1)(r-2)=0$，根 $r=1,2$",
            "通解 $x_n=A+B\\cdot2^n$，代入 $x_0=1:A+B=1$；$x_1=3:A+2B=3$，解得 $B=2,A=-1$",
            "结论：$x_n=2^{n+1}-1$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q08-practice-02",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "验证三阶矩阵（$n=3$）情形下，$D_3$ 直接展开的行列式等于 $1+t^2+t^4+t^6$，从而验证原题通式。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "行列式直接展开",
        "三对角矩阵",
        "递推公式验证"
      ],
      "question_type": "行列式计算验证",
      "method": [
        "按第一行余子式展开三阶行列式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出3阶矩阵",
        "按第一行展开",
        "化简"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "tridiagonal_determinant_direct",
        "template": "\\det D_3, n=3",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$D_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1+t^2&t&0\\\\t&1+t^2&t\\\\0&t&1+t^2\\end{pmatrix}$",
            "按第一行展开：$(1+t^2)\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1+t^2&t\\\\t&1+t^2\\end{pmatrix}-t\\det\\begin{pmatrix}t&t\\\\0&1+t^2\\end{pmatrix}$",
            "$=(1+t^2)(1+t^2+t^4)-t\\cdot t(1+t^2)=(1+t^2)[(1+t^2+t^4)-t^2]=(1+t^2)(1+t^4)$",
            "展开：$(1+t^2)(1+t^4)=1+t^2+t^4+t^6$，与公式 $\\sum_{k=0}^3t^{2k}$ 一致，验证成功"
          ]
        }
      ],
